---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---
<Base title="Aurora Coffee — Small-batch roasting">
  <Hero
    heading="Aurora Coffee"
    tagline="Small-batch roasting in a big-flavor town."
  />
  <p>
    We roast twice a week in the old print shop on Miller Street. Every bag
    ships within two days of roasting, because coffee is produce, not pantry.
  </p>
  <h2>This season</h2>
  <p>
    The spring lineup leans bright: a washed Ethiopia with notes of apricot
    and bergamot, and a Colombian honey process that tastes like caramel
    found an orchard.
  </p>
  <h2>Visit us</h2>
  <p>
    The roastery is open Saturdays from nine to noon. Bring a mug and we will
    fill it while you watch the drum spin.
  </p>
</Base>
